  "body": "Nearly completed, your brand new home is almost ready.\r\n\r\nCrafted well, this contemporary two-storey residence strikes a fine balance between quality and affordability.\r\n\r\nThoughtful design, functional living spaces and premium finishes come together, perfectly suiting both owner occupiers and property investors.\r\n\r\nThe project comprises one 3-bedroom home, two 4-bedroom homes and one spacious 5-bedroom home, offering versatile options to suit various family sizes and investment requirements.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Striking cultural stone feature cladding elevates the home's street appeal\r\n* Internal-access single garage\r\n* Abundant natural light flooding through the interior living areas\r\n* Open-plan living-dining area with designer kitchen, fully equipped with reliable Fisher & Paykel appliances\r\n* Low-maintenance, effortless everyday living\r\n* 10-year Stamford building insurance warranty\r\n\r\n* Artist impression photos are indicative only.\r\n\r\nFor full specifications and further details, please contact Catherine on 021 020 06788 or Barry on 022 506 7888.",
